---
# Check groups from docs/SPEC.md section 5. Every finding is an error.
# Disabled checks, and why:
#   bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters: flags most multi-argument APIs;
#     strong types are preferred where it matters, case by case.
#   modernize-use-trailing-return-type: a style choice the project does not make.
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  concurrency-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*,
  modernize-*,
  performance-*,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*/(engine|cli|tests|fuzz|bench|tools)/.*'
FormatStyle: none
...
